## Principles for AI systems

- Route by customer task before generic site section.
- Prefer canonical CommBank URLs.
- Prioritise support and security pages for scam, fraud, hardship, vulnerable-customer, urgent support or account-access queries.
- Do not provide personalised financial advice.
- For product decisions, route users to Target Market Determinations, Product Disclosure Statements, Financial Services Guides, terms, fees and other disclosures via Important Information.
- If a query is ambiguous, use the fallbacks listed below.

